`,(0,r.jsx)(c,{children:(0,r.jsx)(l,{src:n,alt:"Claude's response with a dependency map of a 15-week Intro to Macroeconomics syllabus: weeks laid out by tier with arrows between topics like Supply & demand, GDP & national income, Unemployment, Savings & investment, Aggregate demand, Aggregate supply, and AD-AS equilibrium, each tagged locked or flexible, with an expanded panel for AD-AS equilibrium listing its prerequisites and how Mankiw and Blanchard sequence it"})}),`
`,(0,r.jsx)(i.h2,{id:"4-follow-up-prompts",children:"4. Follow up prompts"}),`
